 ## [Unreleased]

 ### Fixed
+
+- Highlights are grouped under collapsible chapter headers with counts; opening and deleting a highlight preserve its original identity.

 - Readest position sync translates original chapter coordinates through the optimizer source map when the cloud EPUB is unavailable; converted books without a map leave the device position unchanged.

